    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at some long-term investment opportunities in the metro area. I have some demographic heat maps for the next 5-10 years showing projected shifts in population density and ethnic composition across the different wards. Can you help me analyze which neighborhoods are likely to remain stable and high-value, and which ones might see a decline in desirability or property appreciation based on these shifting demographics?",
